  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。滿懷愛心製作。適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的多款活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>「消失雞蛋孵化」是一款極簡可設定的模組，讓地上的雞蛋能在即將消失前孵化。預設限制新生成數量為 50，以防止無限生成雞隻。物品（及雞蛋）會在 6000 刻（5 分鐘）後消失。預設情況下，雞蛋只有在乾草塊上消失時才會孵化，避免已載入區塊中的野生雞群過度壯大。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含於「原版體驗」模組包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum 的 RPG 組合包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>eggOnlyHatchesWhenOnTopOfHayBlock</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>啟用後，雞蛋只有在乾草塊上時才會孵化，可防止野生雞群在不知不覺中擴張。<br><br><span><strong>eggWillHatchChance</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：1.0，最小值：0，最大值：1.0<br>在實體限制未啟動時，雞蛋在消失前孵化的機率。<br><br><span><strong>onlyHatchIfLessChickensAroundThan</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：50，最小值：0，最大值：1000<br>防止過多實體孵化。若在指定半徑範圍內的雞隻數量少於此設定值，即將消失的雞蛋才會孵化。<br><br><span><strong>radiusEntityLimiterCheck</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：32，最小值：1，最大值：256<br>用於檢測「onlyHatchIfLessChickensAroundThan」設定值的範圍半徑。<br><br><span><strong>newHatchlingIsBaby</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>啟用後，新孵化的雞為小雞形態。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><em>（以下範例中，消失計時器設定為 1 秒）</em></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/despawning-eggs-hatch/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載檔案仍托管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
